; Wait until the interrupt has completed a frame list
;
; Spins until the byte at #R$BDDA is 0 (a NOP). The game frame in the interrupt stores 0 there when it has queued the
; sprite commands of a frame (#R$A5DB); the CALL #R$BDDA that follows runs the list. Used by the intro (#R$8832) and
; the cutscene loop (#R$88DE); the main loop has its own copy of the wait with the one-shot gates inside it (#R$8678).
; .
; Hardware: waits for the frame interrupt without HALT.
;
; O:A 0
@label=WaitFrameList
c$8869 LD A,($BDDA)
 $886C OR A
 $886D JR NZ,$8869
 $886F RET
